  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_DerivativesMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 회사는 특정 위험의 관리 등을 목적으로 금융기관과 파생상품에 대한 약정을 체결하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <entity01515323:CommitmentsAmountUSDOfDisclosureOfFinancialInstitutionCommitmentsLineitemOfDisclosureoffinancialinstitutioncommitmentstable2TableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_DerivativesMember" unitRef="USD" decimals="-6">0</entity01515323:CommitmentsAmountUSDOfDisclosureOfFinancialInstitutionCommitmentsLineitemOfDisclosureoffinancialinstitutioncommitmentstable2TableOfItems>
